{"id":"bd7b31bc9c6fc9f2","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-positive-formula-stability.md","title":"T 正句在经典外延增长下单调而可依赖固定点","display":"prop-positive-formula-stability — T 正句在经典外延增长下单调而可依赖固定点","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-positive-formula-stability","aliases":["91-prop-positive-formula-stability","91-prop-positive-stability"],"display":"prop-positive-formula-stability — T 正句在经典外延增长下单调而可依赖固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]","[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-positive-formula-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-positive-formula-stability</span><span>91-prop-positive-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-positive-formula-stability — T 正句在经典外延增长下单调而可依赖固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a> 的正公式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典满足关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 正句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 为固定基础结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq B\\subseteq|\\mathcal M|\">\\(A\\subseteq B\\subseteq|\\mathcal M|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a> 的直接真理陈述者，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}_J\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}_J\\)</span> 使用全部一致固定点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto B)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto B)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>展开联结词并推否定到原子后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只作正原子；结构归纳证明模型外延扩大保持真。第二行由闭项原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)\">\\(T(t)\\)</span> 的正性及不同一致固定点中的三种取值而得。\n这里不能把展示自指的双条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span> 本身称为正公式；展开双条件可能产生负位置。KF 确实证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 正矩阵的统一 T-双条件（Lemma 15.4），这和跨固定点同值是不同结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.3、Lemma 15.4、Lemma 15.7，印刷页 187、191，PDF 页 198、202。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PosFml}_T$ 为 [[91-df-positive-formula]] 的正公式集；$\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 为经典满足关系。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=T(t)$ 为 [[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]] 的直接真理陈述者，$\\mathrm{Stable}_J$ 使用全部一致固定点。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosFml}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq B\\subseteq|\\mathcal M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto B)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1777,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-positive-formula-stability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-positive-formula-stability]]"}],"outgoing":["e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","8e63bca271dfc8f1"]}